{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<div class=\"text_box\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">港股低開124點，恒生指數報22,952點。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">友邦保險跌百分之3.9，阿里巴巴跌百分之3.1，網易升百分之3.3。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-26T01:59:21.005802+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":57,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"unknown"}}